    "id": "seg-0103",
    "source": "Acknowledgements",
    "kind": "text",
    "context": "h2 > div > article > div > div"
  },
  {
    "id": "seg-0104",
    "source": "Written by Barry Zhang, Keith Lazuka, and Mahesh Murag, who all really like folders. Special thanks to the many others across Anthropic who championed, supported, and built Skills.",
    "kind": "text",
    "context": "p > div > article > div > div"
  },
  {
    "id": "seg-0105",
    "source": "Get the developer newsletter",
    "kind": "text",
